From: Hermes Studio Local Patches <local-patches@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH 0005] feat(group-chat): per-room full local access switch

Restore the local "full local access" room switch (lost in the 0.7.18
upgrade) on the 0.7.18 source layout: a per-room, owner-only toggle that
stops injecting the non-owner workspace-scoped security prompt into
local group-chat Agent runs triggered by non-owner members. The
gc_rooms.fullLocalAccess column already exists in existing databases;
fresh installs get it from the schema. Changing the switch fences and
interrupts current room Agent sessions, like the workspace switch.

Applies on top of patches 0001-0004. Run
`vitest run tests/server/group-chat-full-local-access.test.ts`.

---
